{"about_the_game":"Step into the enchanting world of Mirror Atelier, a captivating sliding jigsaw puzzle game that challenges your perception and delights your artistic senses. Each puzzle is a masterpiece waiting to be unveiled, a fragmented reflection of stunning artwork. Mirror Atelier invites you into a world where stories and puzzles seamlessly merge.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe gameplay in Mirror Atelier features familiar classic sliding puzzle mechanics. As you progress, the puzzles increase in complexity, introducing more pieces that will test your spatial reasoning and patience. With each puzzle you solve, fragments of little stories unfold to make you feel amused and delighted with your achievement.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBeyond the core puzzling, Mirror Atelier offers a tranquil and immersive atmosphere. The visuals are rich and detailed, showcasing a diverse collection of artistic styles. A soothing, ambient soundtrack accompanies your gameplay, creating a relaxing environment.  Enter into Mirror Atelier today and slide into a world of artistic discovery and narrative charm!","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Stage Completed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3766130/214f74215e015115073c4283346dc6ec08726877.jpg"},{"name":"First Level Completed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3766130/47a7ee77522e96f119a249f9cbbfe2c4b0b83ee7.jpg"},{"name":"First Serie Completed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3766130/5832be2bef69d41cd835731f1f331d573ef9d0ed.jpg"},{"name":"Second Serie Completed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3766130/dd0c4821049e9508218c77bd9aea8df181b2eaec.jpg"}],"total":4},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3766130?t=1749662107","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766130/52ad82b